34:32.980 --> 34:34.530
Datuk, nenek, saya pergi main sekejap.

34:34.530 --> 34:35.820
Nanti saya balik lewat sikit.

34:35.820 --> 34:36.460
Jumpa lagi.

34:36.460 --> 34:37.260
Jumpa lagi, pak cik, mak cik.

34:37.260 --> 34:38.719
Jumpa lagi, datuk, nenek.

